# 启动：go run .；也可把这些正文复制到 curl。
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8091

### 健康检查
GET {{base}}/healthz

### 商品列表
GET {{base}}/products?page=1&size=20

### 新增商品；再次执行会返回 409
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":"p-1003","name":"签字笔","price_cents":250,"stock":100}

### 补货
POST {{base}}/products/p-1003/restock
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantity":10}

### 下单；重复相同 request_id 和内容不会再次扣库存
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"request_id":"example-001","customer":"小林","items":[{"product_id":"p-1001","quantity":2}]}

### 状态筛选与分页
GET {{base}}/orders?status=confirmed&page=1&size=20

### 订单详情；ID 换成实际创建结果
GET {{base}}/orders/ord-000001

### 取消，或将 canceled 改为 shipped 测试发货
PATCH {{base}}/orders/ord-000001/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"canceled"}
